00&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9qzAyxAYbbIQ7kNvwEz4aaM&_nc_oc=Ado-rgtj5G34vZ_yi61BgvR5iUSB9OZ6pvT8YM_f2FM_tsIrEVG1hxOQ6vH3njZUmaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPdZxf71o2W88a3dZJ17maeo1W497rZtI9ZE9SOQ7TzBQ&oe=6AC52621"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_PointLookout.png", "id": "884501107671984", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300738_884501111005317_4116624426097535501_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pvt62iiuuTYQ7kNvwFK_8aH&_nc_oc=AdpBmiJOLfA0SzDlOPD7WQwmZRJbTfqwGFt_WM4m4YmCRX1sz43wrcmH-dAKwyRTzSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPJOcB1Y37KSNdV-X6b_Z9nCflkGsryejA4uwsXt7cV5Q&oe=6AC4FCE5"}, "display_name": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Sea Level Rise Explorer: Point Lookout brings you into Point Lookout State Park through an immersive VR experience built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models.\n\nFrom above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient planning.\n\nDesigned as both an educational tool and a platform for public engagement, the experience invites you to explore, interact, and better understand how today\u2019s choices can shape the future of coastal places.", "short_description": "Experience Point Lookout State Park through in immersive VR built with 360-degree video, aerial drone footage, and interactive 3D models. From above the tree line to ground-level views of campgrounds and shorelines, you can see how sea level rise is already transforming the park, and explore nature-based solutions such as marsh restoration, oyster reefs, and climate-resilient infrastructure planning."}]}, "developer_name": null, 